This repository is the **Effect Expert** custom Shopify theme (zero-build). Read `docs/THEME.md` for architecture,
tokens, base classes, snippets, JS events and translation rules. Validate with `npm run check:node` (or
`shopify theme check`) and keep `npm run size` within budget.
